@hostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{hostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Example endpoint
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/ping
Accept: application/json

### Register (sets the refresh cookie)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1"
}

### Login (sets the refresh cookie)
# @name login
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1"
}

### Current user (paste the accessToken from the login response)
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh (relies on the refresh cookie; rotates it)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh

### Logout (revokes the refresh token and clears the cookie)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

###

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restaurants (Super Admin unless noted). Paste a Super Admin access token.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@superAdminToken = paste-access-token-here
@managerToken = paste-manager-access-token-here
@restaurantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create restaurant
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

{
  "name": "Spice Garden",
  "city": "Pune",
  "contactEmail": "hello@spicegarden.example"
}

### List restaurants
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Restaurant details
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Assign manager - create a new account
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/manager
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Riya Manager",
  "email": "riya@spicegarden.example",
  "password": "StrongPass1"
}

### Assign manager - promote an existing user
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/manager
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Manager: my restaurant (no id in the request)
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/restaurants/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
